message: "Cite this software DOI for the 1.4.0 implementation; cite the separate 1.3 preprint for its historical research. The DOI was reserved at source freeze; check Zenodo for publication status."
title: "EACP Operational-Provenance Artifact: Collection Security and Resilience"
abstract: >-
  Version 1.4.0 security and resilience reference artifact, preserving Profile 1.3
  semantics and historical experimental evidence. Adds minimized public
  projections, authenticated collector statements, encrypted durable ingestion,
  tenant-scoped access, externally anchored snapshot verification and isolated
  attestation workflow with retained live verification. Tests are author-executed; independent
  reproduction, organizational pilots and production validation are not claimed.
  The archived software DOI in references identifies the artifact, not the accompanying
  article. Licensing is file-scoped; see LICENSES/README.md and paper/README.md.
